cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use LEGACY-CONTRACT in your research, please cite it using
  the metadata below.
title: >
  LEGACY-CONTRACT: Execution-Grounded Behavioral Contract Recovery
  for Legacy Batch Modernization Risk Detection
abstract: >
  A research platform for the automatic recovery, dynamic validation, and
  change-risk detection of implicit behavioral contracts embedded in COBOL/JCL
  batch systems. The system formalizes behavioral obligations as a Behavioral
  Contract Graph (BCG = (V, E, C, P, D, Γ)) and evaluates them against a
  fault-grounded mutation benchmark derived from documented real-world
  modernization failures.
authors:
  - name: "LEGACY-CONTRACT Research Team"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ManasSakthivel/RELIC"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2025-08-17"
keywords:
  - legacy modernization
  - behavioral contracts
  - COBOL
  - JCL
  - program analysis
  - software engineering
  - mutation testing
  - dynamic analysis
